{
  "slug": "vps-ops",
  "name": "Vps Ops",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Monitor and manage a Linux VPS running WordPress, PM2 services, and Nginx. Checks service health, analyses Nginx logs for AI crawler activity, verifies backups, manages redirects, and runs WordPress site health checks. Includes 6 skills: health-check, log-analysis, backup-check, redirect, site-health, and wp-audit.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 agent**, **4 commands** and **3 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `backup-manager` (Verify backup integrity, check backup schedules, and confirm recent backups completed successfully), `log-analyser` (Analyse Nginx access and error logs to surface traffic patterns, AI crawler activity, cache performance, error spikes, and…), `nginx-manager` (Manage Nginx configuration safely: validate syntax, reload, check SSL certificate expiry, review active virtual hosts, and diagnose configuration…), `service-monitor` (Monitor all VPS services: PM2 processes, Nginx, PHP-FPM, PostgreSQL, Redis, and systemd units)\n- **Agents** (1): `monday-digest` (Autonomous Monday morning infrastructure digest)\n- **Commands** (4): `backups` (Verify all VPS backups completed successfully), `health` (Full VPS service health check), `logs` (Analyse Nginx access and error logs), `nginx` (Manage Nginx configuration)\n- **MCP servers** (3): `~~filesystem`, `~~wordpress`, `~~knowledge_base`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install vps-ops@claude-community` from `arturseo-geo/cowork-vps-ops`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
